---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — The Ritz Menu Guide"
  description="Privacy policy for The Ritz Menu Guide: what we collect (almost nothing), cookies, and third-party links."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-guide mt-8">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Almost nothing. This site does not run accounts, comments, newsletters, or contact
        forms. We do not ask for your name, email address, or any personal information.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not currently use analytics cookies or tracking pixels. If that
        changes, this policy will be updated to describe exactly what's collected and why.
      </p>
      <h2>Server logs</h2>
      <p>
        Like nearly every website, our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may log standard
        technical data — such as IP addresses and pages requested — for security and
        operations. We don't use these logs to identify individuals.
      </p>
      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        We link to external sites (for example, theritzlondon.com). Those sites have their
        own privacy policies; we aren't responsible for their practices.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions can be raised through the public profiles on our
        <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
